fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"controller/gsttimedvaluecontrolsource.html#gst_timed_value_control_source_list_control_points","fragment":"\n\tgst_timed_value_control_source_list_control_points\n\n\n\tGstController.TimedValueControlSource.prototype.list_control_points\n\n\n\tGstController.TimedValueControlSource.list_control_points\n\nReturns an array of GstTimedValue representing the control points\nthat have been set on this control source. To modify the value of a\ncontrol point, use gst_timed_value_control_source_set.\nParameters:\nthe GstTimedValueControlSource to get the list from\nlocation to store the number of control points\nan array of\ncontrol points, or NULL if no control points are set.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nReturns an array of Gst.TimedValue representing the control points\nthat have been set on this control source. To modify the value of a\ncontrol point, use GstController.TimedValueControlSource.prototype.set.\nParameters:\nthe GstController.TimedValueControlSource to get the list from\nReturns a tuple made of:\nan array of\ncontrol points, or null if no control points are set.\nan array of\ncontrol points, or null if no control points are set.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nReturns an array of Gst.TimedValue representing the control points\nthat have been set on this control source. To modify the value of a\ncontrol point, use GstController.TimedValueControlSource.set.\nParameters:\nthe GstController.TimedValueControlSource to get the list from\nReturns a tuple made of:\nan array of\ncontrol points, or None if no control points are set.\nan array of\ncontrol points, or None if no control points are set.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});